      "en": "Then some of the elders of Israel came to me and sat before me.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 장로 두어사람이 나아와 내 앞에 앉으니",
      "source_text_hash": "fb65a660ea21751d060ddda83221dad78541384a38299568c36f5ab0f3412ef3",
      "translation_text_hash": "d587f52079f5cf3f72e232200842018940870edd57900416ba7b369c5090a681",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이스라엘 장로 두어사람이 나아와 내 앞에 앉으니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d587f52079f5cf3f72e232200842018940870edd57900416ba7b369c5090a681"
      ]
